      "parameters": {
        "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"id\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Invoice - {{ $('On form submission').item.json['Nama Klien'] }}</title>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <style>\n        /* CSS Reset Minimal */\n        body, h1, h2, h3, h4, p, table, th, td { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;\n            background-color: #FFF9E3; /* Butter Yellow Background */\n            color: #1a1a1a;\n            padding: 40px;\n            font-size: 14px;\n        }\n\n        .invoice-container {\n            max-width: 850px;\n            margin: auto;\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            border-radius: 8px;\n            padding: 50px;\n            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n            /* Ini bagian item-item di atas layer dalam */\n            border-top: 10px solid #000000; \n            position: relative;\n        }\n\n        .invoice-header {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            align-items: flex-start;\n            margin-bottom: 40px;\n            padding-bottom: 20px;\n            /* Garis tetep hitam tapi dibikin 1px biar nggak terlalu kereng */\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; \n        }\n\n        .company-logo {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            font-weight: 700; /* Dikurangi dari 800 biar gak numpuk/gepeng */\n            color: #000000;\n            margin-bottom: 10px; /* Tambahan jarak ke bawah biar gak nempel */\n            /* Uppercase dan letter-spacing dihapus biar natural */\n        }\n\n        .company-details p {\n            font-size: 13px;\n            color: #444;\n            line-height: 1.4;\n        }\n\n        .invoice-meta {\n            text-align: right;\n        }\n\n        .invoice-title {\n            font-size: 36px;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: #000000;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n            line-height: 1;\n        }\n\n        .invoice-details p {\n            color: #555;\n            margin-bottom: 5px;\n        }\n\n        .invoice-details strong {\n            color: #000;\n        }\n\n        .invoice-addresses {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n\n        .address-box {\n            width: 45%;\n        }\n\n        .address-box h3 {\n            font-size: 12px;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            letter-spacing: 1px;\n            color: #000;\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #000;\n            display: inline-block;\n        }\n\n        .address-content p {\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n\n        .address-content .client-name {\n            font-size: 18px;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            margin-bottom: 3px;\n            color: #000;\n        }\n\n        .address-content .client-email {\n            color: #000;\n            font-weight: 500;\n            text-decoration: underline;\n        }\n\n        .invoice-table {\n            width: 100%;\n            border-collapse: collapse;\n            margin-bottom: 40px;\n        }\n\n        .invoice-table th {\n            text-align: left;\n            padding: 15px;\n            background-color: #000000; /* Header Tabel Hitam */\n            color: #ffffff;\n            font-size: 12px;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            font-weight: 600;\n        }\n\n        .invoice-table td {\n            padding: 18px 15px;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;\n        }\n\n        .invoice-table td.qty-rate, .invoice-table th.qty-rate,\n        .invoice-table td.subtotal, .invoice-table th.subtotal {\n            text-align: right;\n        }\n\n        .item-description {\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: #000;\n        }\n\n        .invoice-summary {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: flex-end;\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n\n        .summary-box {\n            width: 40%;\n        }\n\n        .summary-item {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            padding: 10px 0;\n            font-size: 14px;\n        }\n\n        .summary-item.total {\n            margin-top: 10px;\n            padding: 15px 0;\n            font-size: 22px;\n            font-weight: 800;\n            color: #000;\n            border-top: 1px solid #000000; /* Disamain jadi 1px */\n        }\n\n        .invoice-footer {\n            border-top: 1px solid #ddd;\n            padding-top: 30px;\n            text-align: center;\n            color: #666;\n            font-size: 12px;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n\n        .currency {\n            font-weight: 700;\n        }\n\n        .invoice-number {\n            background-color: #000;\n            color: #fff;\n            padding: 2px 10px;\n            border-radius: 20px;\n            font-size: 12px;\n        }\n\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"invoice-container\">\n        <div class=\"invoice-header\">\n            <div class=\"company-details\">\n                <div class=\"company-logo\">Ays Company</div>\n                <p>Jl. Jend. Sudirman Kav. 50</p>\n                <p>Jakarta Selatan, Indonesia, 12930</p>\n                <p>support@ayscompany.co.id</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"invoice-meta\">\n                <div class=\"invoice-title\">INVOICE</div>\n                <div class=\"invoice-details\">\n                    <p>No: <span class=\"invoice-number\">INV-2008</span></p>\n                    <p>Tanggal: <strong>14 April 2026</strong></p>\n                    <p>Tempo: <strong>28 April 2026</strong></p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"invoice-addresses\">\n            <div class=\"address-box\">\n                <h3>Dari</h3>\n                <div class=\"address-content\">\n                    <p class=\"client-name\">Ays Company</p>\n                    <p>Tim Pengembang Aplikasi</p>\n                    <p>Layanan Pengembangan Software Kustom</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"address-box\">\n                <h3>Ditagihkan Kepada</h3>\n                <div class=\"address-content\">\n                    <p class=\"client-name\">{{ $('On form submission').item.json['Nama Klien'] }}</p>\n                    <p class=\"client-email\">{{ $('On form submission').item.json['Email Klien'] }}</p>\n                    <p>Jakarta, Indonesia</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <table class=\"invoice-table\">\n            <thead>\n                <tr>\n                    <th>Deskripsi Layanan</th>\n                    <th class=\"qty-rate\">Jam</th>\n                    <th class=\"qty-rate\">Rate (Rp)</th>\n                    <th class=\"subtotal\">Subtotal (Rp)</th>\n                </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n                <tr>\n                    <td class=\"item-description\">Jasa Pekerjaan / Konsultasi Sistem</td>\n                    <td class=\"qty-rate\">{{ $('On form submission').item.json['Jam Kerja'] }}</td>\n                    <td class=\"qty-rate\">{{ $('On form submission').item.json.Rate }}</td>\n                    <td class=\"subtotal\"><span class=\"currency\">{{ $json[\"Total Biaya\"] }}</span></td>\n                </tr>\n            </tbody>\n        </table>\n\n        <div class=\"invoice-summary\">\n            <div class=\"summary-box\">\n                <div class=\"summary-item\">\n                    <span>Subtotal</span>\n                    <span>{{ $json[\"Total Biaya\"] }}</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"summary-item\">\n                    <span>Pajak (0%)</span>\n                    <span>0</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"summary-item total\">\n                    <strong>Total</strong>\n                    <strong><span class=\"currency\">Rp {{ $json[\"Total Biaya\"] }}</span></strong>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"invoice-footer\">\n            <p><strong>Syarat &amp; Ketentuan</strong></p>\n            <p>Pembayaran penuh jatuh tempo dalam waktu 14 hari sejak tanggal invoice.</p>\n            <p>Silakan hubungi kami di support@ayscompany.co.id untuk pertanyaan pembayaran.</p>\n            <br>\n            <p><em>Invoice ini dibuat secara otomatis oleh sistem internal Ays.</em></p>\n            <p>Terima kasih atas kepercayaan Anda bermitra dengan <strong>Ays Company</strong>.</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
      },
